            "text": "{\"schemaVersion\":1,\"ok\":false,\"error\":{\"code\":\"BINARY_NOT_FOUND\",\"message\":\"ast-grep binary not found for linux: no candidate passed the --version probe across the env override, MPD runtime, skill bin cache, PATH, or Homebrew prefixes.\",\"retryable\":false,\"phase\":\"preflight\",\"details\":{\"hints\":[\"npm install -g @ast-grep/cli\",\"cargo install ast-grep --locked\",\"brew install ast-grep  # linuxbrew\",\"Start an MPD session so the bundled ast-grep skill provisions the pinned runtime automatically\",\"Or point MPD_AST_GREP_SG_PATH at an existing ast-grep binary\"]}}}"
